The graph R10_12_857.txt, the file theorem3_R10_12_857.txt and README.md: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
(CC BY 4.0), https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/ . Please credit Peter J. Chrisbacher and cite this repository.
R10_12_857.txt contains two parts of Google's graph unchanged, as induced subgraphs: the first 797 vertices (which are also
the Paley graph on 797 vertices) and rows 797 to 835 of Google's file. The edges between those two parts and the 20 new
vertices are new. Google's own edges between the parts and Google's last 19 vertices are not included.

input_google_R10_12_856.txt: Copyright Google LLC, from https://github.com/google-research/google-research
(ramsey_number_bounds/improved_bounds/R(10, 12) >= 856.txt, commit 0d94f8c), redistributed unchanged (renamed) with
attribution. That repository licenses source files under the Apache License 2.0 (text in LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt) and
datasets under CC BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
